      "title": {
        "en": "Convenient stations with maintenance concerns"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Most pet owners praise the 24-hour outdoor wash bays on Morena Boulevard, noting that elevated tubs prevent back strain and offer an easy stop after visits to Fiesta Island. However, several reviewers noted issues with broken dryer nozzles, lack of supplied towels, and steps that are not wheelchair friendly."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "animals",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 8,
      "title": {
        "en": "Easy bathing for large dogs"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Owners of large breeds, including German Shepherds and long-haired doodles, appreciate the spacious gated enclosures and warm water spray. Reviewers mention that pets tolerate the automated tubs comfortably, with sanitiser cycles ensuring clean stalls between different dogs."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "prices",
      "sentiment": "mixed",
      "mentions": 6,
      "title": {
        "en": "Divided views on wash value"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "While several customers describe the automated wash as an affordable DIY alternative to full salons, others feel sixteen dollars for a fifteen-minute timer is steep, especially when trying to fully dry thick-coated breeds like huskies before the countdown runs out."
      }
    }
  ],
  "faq": [
    {
      "q": {
        "en": "Is the DoggoWash on Morena Boulevard open round the clock?"
      },
      "a": {
        "en": "Yes, the automated outdoor self-serve wash facility operates 24 hours a day on Morena Boulevard."
      },
      "basis": "both"
    },
    {
      "q": {
        "en": "Are towels provided at the wash bays?"
      },
      "a": {
        "en": "No, customers must bring their own towels as only automated blow dryers and cleaning supplies are available."
